sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User Browser
  participant CF as Cloudflare Edge
  participant C as cloudflared
  participant T as Traefik
  participant A as App container
  U->>CF: https://hello.example.com
  CF->>C: Tunnel request (outbound connection)
  C->>T: HTTP request + Host header
  T->>A: Route by Host label, internal port 80
  A-->>T: HTTP response
  T-->>C: HTTP response
  C-->>CF: Tunnel response
  CF-->>U: HTTPS response
